<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP/CONFERENCE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP/CONFERENCE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of European Cup and European Conference quarter-finals on Saturday:</p>
<p>European Cup</p>
<p> Cardiff		22     Bath	     19</p>
<p> Leicester	    23     Harlequins     13</p>
<p> Dax		    18     Toulouse	 26</p>
<p>Semifinals (January 4/5):</p>
<p>Leicester v Toulouse</p>
<p>Brive or Llanelli (playing Sunday) v Cardiff </p>
<p>European Conference</p>
<p>Bourgoin	  17     Montferrand    15</p>
<p>Northampton     22     Narbonne	 23</p>
<p>Agen		20     Begles	   15 (aet. score at 80 mins 10-10)</p>
<p>Castres	   23     Toulon	   15</p>
<p>Semifinals (January 4/5):</p>
<p>Castres v Agen</p>
<p>Bourgoin v Narbonne</p>
